                    787.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Employees may be loaned on a basis other than as above prescribed; provided that in such event the method of bidding on such loans, the method of moving employees between departments as the loans terminate, the method of calling for additional employees, and any other part of the loaning procedure shall be by mutual agreement between the Union and the Company.",
